#: apps.py:13
msgid "Invoicing"
msgstr "Facturación"

#: apps.py:19
msgid ""
"Every charged sale becomes a numbered ticket or invoice, corrected only by "
"rectifying invoices."
msgstr ""
"Cada venta cobrada se convierte en un tique o una factura numerada, que solo"
" se corrige con rectificativas."

#: apps.py:22
msgid ""
"Invoicing turns every charged sale into its fiscal document: a simplified "
"invoice for a ticket, a full invoice when the customer gives a tax ID, the "
"full invoice that replaces a ticket the customer already took, and the "
"rectifying invoice of every refund and void. Each document is numbered in "
"its series and year with no gaps, carries the business as issuer, is never "
"edited and is printed or saved as PDF. Invoices issued by hand, marked as "
"paid and the numbering series are managed here too, ready for VeriFactu."
msgstr ""
"Facturación convierte cada venta cobrada en su documento fiscal: la factura "
"simplificada de un tique, la factura completa cuando el cliente da su NIF, "
"la factura completa que sustituye a un tique que el cliente ya se llevó y la"
" rectificativa de cada devolución y anulación. Cada documento se numera en "
"su serie y su año sin huecos, lleva al negocio como emisor, nunca se edita y"
" se imprime o se guarda en PDF. Aquí también se emiten facturas a mano, se "
"marcan como pagadas y se llevan las series de numeración, listas para "
"VeriFactu."

